# The image (see Dockerfile) needs the Cargo workspace's manifests, the
# relay's source and the dashboard's. Nothing else goes to the builder:
# no build output, no node_modules, no local database, certificates or keys.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src/update
!src/installer
!src/app
!src/server/relay
!src/server/package.json
!src/server/bun.lock
!src/server/frontend

**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-*
**/gen
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db
